\f0\fs24 \cf0 ## [Date] \'97 xE fix: alphaParameterSmooth16 \uc0\u8594  alphaParameterSmooth17\
\
### What was changed\
`firm.py`, `learning()` method: switched call from\
`self.mind.alphaParameterSmooth16(...)` to `self.mind.alphaParameterSmooth17(...)`\
\
### Why\
alphaParameterSmooth16 incorrectly revised xE downward when supply was\
the binding constraint (paper Eq.14 requires holding xE constant).\
This caused a continuous xE ratchet keeping nWorkerDesired >> 500.\
alphaParameterSmooth17 implements the correct logic and removes the\
theoretically unjustified 0.85 production smoothing term.\
\
