\
### Interpretation\
Major improvement in labour market stability (jumpiness halved).\
Wage share and loans/GDP recovered to plausible levels.\
nWorkerDesired increased (not decreased) because removing the 0.85\
production smoothing makes xProducing more aggressive. Unemployment\
and debt/GDP remain above target \'97 recalibration needed.\
Trajectories are stable \'97 model has a genuine attractor.\
Cross-run CV on wage share = 0.037 (very tight).\
\
### Status\
\uc0\u9888 \u65039  Fix applied and working. Recalibration required.\
